{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1438199-first-mention-of-koldunic-sorcery","id":1438199,"title":"first mention of Koldunic Sorcery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-05T16:39:22-08:00","id":1438199,"title":"first mention of Koldunic Sorcery","content":"What sourcebook first mentioned Koldunic Sorcery? Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T19:10:53-08:00","id":1438214,"title":"","content":"I want to say it was one of the Dark Ages books - maybe Transylvania by Night? - but I'd have to dig my stuff out to check.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T23:34:10-08:00","id":1438272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1438199-first-mention-of-koldunic-sorcery?p=1438214#post1438214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to say it was one of the Dark Ages books - maybe Transylvania by Night? - but I'd have to dig my stuff out to check.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Want to say Libellus Sanguinius: Masters of the State. Transylvania by Night references that for Koldun rituals","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T02:08:59-08:00","id":1438281,"title":"","content":"Taggie has the right of it: Page 62 of <i>Libellus Sanguinis 1: Masters of the State</i> (1997) is the first time Koldunic Sorcery is presented as a unique discipline. Although Koldunic Sorcery is said to be incompatible with Thaumaturgy, they are mechanically identical in <i>Vampire: The Dark Ages.</i> Koldunic paths are simply Thaumaturgy paths with alternative names; only Koldunic rituals are unique to the discipline at this stage.<br /> <br /> However, the first mention of <i>koldun</i> precedes any writeup of Koldunic Sorcery. The first Tzimisce clanbook (1995) talks about <i>koldun</i> on page 26. Here, it's simply a term for Tzimisce who practice Thaumaturgy. This shouldn't be understood as <i>Tremere</i> Thaumaturgy -- the early editions used &quot;Thaumaturgy&quot; as a general term for vampiric blood sorcery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1190-elphilm","name":"Elphilm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1190_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"763"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}